From 97d90f4266c51f50c0f2360f52552566d2c15316 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:00:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] test-posix: Check getpwent, setpwent and endpwent, and
 the shared parser

getpwent leaves errno alone at the end, setpwent and endpwent rewind
and close without touching errno, and every name fits
{LOGIN_NAME_MAX}. fgetpwent and fgetpwent_r (extensions) show how
lines are parsed: malformed ones skipped, 32-bit ids, empty last
fields, long lines, and ERANGE leaving the entry to be read again.
---
